name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-preassessment-q9_2026-pilot'

question 'When checking whether an AI-generated image or message is trustworthy, which strategy is most useful?'

right 'Slow down, look for specific details that can be verified, and cross-check against reliable sources.'
wrong 'Trust the output if the AI tool is from a well-known company.'
wrong 'Assume the AI is always correct if it gives a confident-sounding response.'
wrong 'Only check AI outputs if you personally feel unsure about the topic.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

